.* USER: the task menu for the tasks a user does for their own work.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='USER'.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGPWD PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPMSG PNLGRP=QHMHCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=EDTLIBL PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SBMJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SIGNOFF PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SNDMSG PNLGRP=QHMHCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSBMJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSPLF PNLGRP=QHSPCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=USER HELP=HLPUSER KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.User Tasks
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKJOB' HELP=WRKJOB.Display or change your job
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD DSPMSG' HELP=DSPMSG.Display messages
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?SNDMSG' HELP=SNDMSG.Send a message
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?SBMJOB' HELP=SBMJOB.Submit a job
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD WRKSPLF' HELP=WRKSPLF.Work with your spooled output files
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD WRKSBMJOB' HELP=WRKSBMJOB.Work with your batch jobs
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD EDTLIBL' HELP=EDTLIBL.Display or change your library list
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD CHGPWD' HELP=CHGPWD.Change your password
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD CHGPRF' HELP='USER/OPT9'.Change your user profile
:MENUI OPTION=60 ACTION='MENU USER2' HELP='USER/OPT60'.More user task options
:MENUI OPTION=90 ACTION='CMD SIGNOFF' HELP=SIGNOFF.Sign off
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPUSER.User Tasks - Help
:P.Each option works on the signed-on user's own job, messages, output and
profile.
:P.Option 60 shows the second page of user tasks; option 90 ends the
session.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='USER/OPT9'.Change your user profile
:P.Option 9. Runs the CHGPRF command&colon. Change your user profile.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='USER/OPT60'.More user task options
:P.Option 60. Shows menu USER2&colon. More user task options.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
